{"3921700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sky Aces", "steam_appid": 3921700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take to the skies in <i>Sky Aces</i>, a fast–paced air combat game where chaos rules and every second counts.</strong> <br>Master fantastical aircraft, survive impossible battles, and prove yourself as an ace above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/fbf5876d65f52f659543fac346c1ffca.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaotic Dogfights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Sky Aces</i> is pure chaos. Enemy planes can strike from any direction, missiles scream through the sky, and every maneuver could save (or end) your life. Dogfights are unpredictable, forcing you to stay sharp and adapt on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/6bf8e8dece5378eae4afc361c047686c.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1560 height=742 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Aircraft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each aircraft in <i>Sky Aces</i> can be tuned and modified to match your playstyle. From faster engines and tighter turns to heavy cannons and experimental tech, your build determines how you fight, and how long you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/f7f528b893d5cdad1f36c11828bf7527.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1560 height=826 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fantastical Battlefields</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the ordinary. Battles unfold in surreal skies where the laws of physics break apart. Soar around floating islands, dive through storm-wracked cloud mazes, or fight near colossal airborne structures. Every battlefield offers unique challenges and opportunities for daring maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/21da1e30cad699f8403a867d031c7c00.poster.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/21da1e30cad699f8403a867d031c7c00.webm?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/21da1e30cad699f8403a867d031c7c00.mp4?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strange &amp; Advanced Technologies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every machine in <i>Sky Aces</i> belongs to this world. Experimental engines, energy cannons, and mysterious artifacts push aircraft beyond conventional limits. Choosing when to unleash this strange technology can turn the tide of battle... or backfire catastrophically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/75acf6ccc8fe69573eca8880f14fe02e.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sound-Based Detection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Sky Aces</i>, radar doesn’t exist. Instead, aircraft are tracked through the sounds they produce. Your plane can detect and mark enemy fighters based on their noise, while missiles lock on using sound signatures. Staying quiet can decide who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.poster.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.webm?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.mp4?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Pilot Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every aircraft comes with its own special ability. From sudden bursts of speed, to evasive maneuvers, to devastating weapon overdrives! Mastering when to use these powers is just as important as pulling the trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic and responsive AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI in <i>Sky Aces</i> is far from a simple target. It adapts to the environment and reacts to the planes around it. It will pressure you at the worst possible moments, but it can also make fatal mistakes. Exploit them, and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvP Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sky Aces</i> offers multiple competitive modes where teamwork and strategy make the difference:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>: Each kill grants points. The first team to reach the target score wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aerial Heist</strong>: Supply drops appear across the map. Capture them with your aircraft, deliver them to your base, and score points. The team that reaches the target score first claims victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky Dominance</strong>: Conquer aerial control points and hold them to gain points over time. The first team to hit the target score wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.poster.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.webm?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.mp4?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teamwork Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the skies, no pilot fights alone. Cover your allies, coordinate attacks, and survive together. Remember: you’re no use to the team if you go down in flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sky Aces</i> is designed to be accessible: jump in and start fighting. But mastering the skies, managing strange technologies, and outthinking the AI and real players takes time, skill, and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>How long would you last above the clouds?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Disclaimer:</u></i></strong><i> All music used in this game is in the Public Domain and/or under a Creative Commons license. However, some streaming or video platforms may incorrectly flag it as copyrighted content. If you plan to stream or upload gameplay, you can contact the developer, who will provide all the necessary material to avoid or counter such claims.</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Take to the skies in <i>Sky Aces</i>, a fast–paced air combat game where chaos rules and every second counts.</strong> <br>Master fantastical aircraft, survive impossible battles, and prove yourself as an ace above the clouds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/fbf5876d65f52f659543fac346c1ffca.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Chaotic Dogfights</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in <i>Sky Aces</i> is pure chaos. Enemy planes can strike from any direction, missiles scream through the sky, and every maneuver could save (or end) your life. Dogfights are unpredictable, forcing you to stay sharp and adapt on the fly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/6bf8e8dece5378eae4afc361c047686c.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1560 height=742 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customizable Aircraft</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each aircraft in <i>Sky Aces</i> can be tuned and modified to match your playstyle. From faster engines and tighter turns to heavy cannons and experimental tech, your build determines how you fight, and how long you survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/f7f528b893d5cdad1f36c11828bf7527.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1560 height=826 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fantastical Battlefields</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget the ordinary. Battles unfold in surreal skies where the laws of physics break apart. Soar around floating islands, dive through storm-wracked cloud mazes, or fight near colossal airborne structures. Every battlefield offers unique challenges and opportunities for daring maneuvers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/21da1e30cad699f8403a867d031c7c00.poster.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/21da1e30cad699f8403a867d031c7c00.webm?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/21da1e30cad699f8403a867d031c7c00.mp4?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Strange &amp; Advanced Technologies</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every machine in <i>Sky Aces</i> belongs to this world. Experimental engines, energy cannons, and mysterious artifacts push aircraft beyond conventional limits. Choosing when to unleash this strange technology can turn the tide of battle... or backfire catastrophically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/75acf6ccc8fe69573eca8880f14fe02e.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1560 height=854 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sound-Based Detection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Sky Aces</i>, radar doesn’t exist. Instead, aircraft are tracked through the sounds they produce. Your plane can detect and mark enemy fighters based on their noise, while missiles lock on using sound signatures. Staying quiet can decide who survives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.poster.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.webm?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.mp4?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unique Pilot Abilities</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every aircraft comes with its own special ability. From sudden bursts of speed, to evasive maneuvers, to devastating weapon overdrives! Mastering when to use these powers is just as important as pulling the trigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic and responsive AI</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The AI in <i>Sky Aces</i> is far from a simple target. It adapts to the environment and reacts to the planes around it. It will pressure you at the worst possible moments, but it can also make fatal mistakes. Exploit them, and turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PvP Game Modes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sky Aces</i> offers multiple competitive modes where teamwork and strategy make the difference:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Team Deathmatch</strong>: Each kill grants points. The first team to reach the target score wins.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aerial Heist</strong>: Supply drops appear across the map. Capture them with your aircraft, deliver them to your base, and score points. The team that reaches the target score first claims victory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sky Dominance</strong>: Conquer aerial control points and hold them to gain points over time. The first team to hit the target score wins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.poster.avif?t=1759588729\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.webm?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/extras/cd07903aeef2741714657bf80abf136a.mp4?t=1759588729\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Teamwork Matters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the skies, no pilot fights alone. Cover your allies, coordinate attacks, and survive together. Remember: you’re no use to the team if you go down in flames.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Easy to Learn, Hard to Master</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sky Aces</i> is designed to be accessible: jump in and start fighting. But mastering the skies, managing strange technologies, and outthinking the AI and real players takes time, skill, and courage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>How long would you last above the clouds?</i></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Disclaimer:</u></i></strong><i> All music used in this game is in the Public Domain and/or under a Creative Commons license. However, some streaming or video platforms may incorrectly flag it as copyrighted content. If you plan to stream or upload gameplay, you can contact the developer, who will provide all the necessary material to avoid or counter such claims.</i></p>", "short_description": "Sky Aces is a combat flight simulator that places you at the controls of unique battle planes in a world where technology is totally different. Experience PvP and PvE battles with team objectives, rich combat mechanics and lots of customization, discovering breathtaking landscapes and technologies!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/4c6fcabe2343c2d816c1f08ca5699fd23308d192/header.jpg?t=1759588729", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/553199c7417a6d3f49409d7481e1c76acb751ad3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759588729", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/553199c7417a6d3f49409d7481e1c76acb751ad3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759588729", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Fireruner"], "publishers": ["Fireruner"], "demos": [{"appid": 3922070, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 28, "description": "Full controller support"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 70, "description": "Surround Sound"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "4", "description": "Casual"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}, {"id": "28", "description": "Simulation"}, {"id": "70", "description": "Early Access"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/3cfdeafdc4cccf34ff3ccb21494e8f4f589c7070/ss_3cfdeafdc4cccf34ff3ccb21494e8f4f589c7070.600x338.jpg?t=1759588729", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3921700/3cfdeafdc4cccf34ff3ccb21494e8f4f589c7070/ss_3cfdeafdc4cccf34ff3ccb21494e8f4f589c7070.1920x1080.jpg?t=1759588729"}, {"id": 1